OL,3,GNEWSAStatue commemorates miners who
OL,4,Adied in explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statue honouring ten miners who died
OL,7,Fworking in a pit 140 years ago has been
OL,8,Funveiled.
OL,10,FOn 10 September 1886, a huge
OL,11,Funderground explosion at Dean Lane Pit
OL,12,Fin Bedminster, Bristol, killed the
OL,13,Fworkers, including a 15-year-old, and
OL,14,Finjured many more.
OL,16,FGary Atterton from Bedminster
OL,17,FCoalminers Heritage Group, said he
OL,18,Fhoped the 7ft (2.1m) tall metal minor,
OL,19,Fat Dame Emily Park in Bedminster, would
OL,20,Fremind people of a "forgotten part of
OL,21,FBristol's history".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
