OL,3,GNEWSAStatue commemorates miners who
OL,4,Adied in explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We had four major coal mines in
OL,7,FBedminster and thousands of workers
OL,8,Fover the years, toiling below our
OL,9,Ffeet," he added.
